30:12.060 --> 30:13.228
Tulong!

30:25.782 --> 30:27.408
Tabi! Sinabing tabi!

30:37.085 --> 30:39.170
- Dito!
- Tulong!

30:40.129 --> 30:42.841
- Pakibuksan ang pinto!
- Tulong!

30:42.924 --> 30:43.925
Dito!

30:51.850 --> 30:58.273
