31:08.491 --> 31:10.285
Uy, atras!

31:10.368 --> 31:17.375
LIPUNANG ITATAYO BATAY SA MABUTING ASAL

31:23.631 --> 31:25.008
Moon Baek, tabi!

31:27.719 --> 31:29.262
