- Bilisan n'yo!

31:30.805 --> 31:31.890
- Labas!
- Bilis!

31:32.849 --> 31:33.850
Ingat!

31:34.559 --> 31:36.060
Ha? Buwisit.

31:50.617 --> 31:51.618
