32:01.085 --> 32:03.212
- Dito. Dali!
- Pasok dito!

32:03.713 --> 32:05.048
- Dito. Bilis!
- Dali!

32:06.007 --> 32:07.467
Bilis. Isara n'yo!

32:07.550 --> 32:09.177
- Andito na lahat?
- Harangan natin!

32:09.260 --> 32:10.553
