- Bilis!

32:10.637 --> 32:11.721
Harangan natin!

32:11.804 --> 32:13.514
Wag n'yong isara! Please!

32:22.607 --> 32:24.442
Tang ina, pumasok na kayo!

32:25.443 --> 32:26.736
Sige na, dali!

32:26.819 --> 32:27.779
Sige pa!

32:29.906 --> 32:31.115
