32:32.992 --> 32:34.077
Bilis, tulak!

32:37.038 --> 32:38.039
Tulak!

32:46.255 --> 32:47.256
Tara, bilis!

32:49.509 --> 32:50.343
Dali!

33:10.446 --> 33:12.448
Tang ina talaga.

33:21.457 --> 33:22.500
Kang Seong-jun!

33:25.586 --> 33:27.296
Alam kong nandito ka. Lumabas ka na.

33:33.636 --> 33:36.055
Kang Seong-jun!
Oh Sang-tae! Hwang Yu-seok!

33:36.889 --> 33:38.891
